/P 227 0 R
/E (The primary objective of this initiative was to improve access to quality primary healthcare services for underserved communities across District Rahim Yar Khan. Through free medical camps, the project aimed to reduce financial barriers to healthcare, promote early diagnosis of common illnesses, and provide timely treatment through qualified medical professionals.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
329 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 227 0 R
/E (The project also sought to strengthen community well-being by increasing awareness of preventive healthcare practices and encouraging early medical intervention. By partnering with local stakeholders, the initiative ensured healthcare services reached vulnerable populations in both rural and urban communities.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
