347 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 228 0 R
/T (The first medical camp was successfully conducted in Dhabeweli, District Rahim Yar Khan, providing essential healthcare services to approximately 250 community members. The camp was organized to address the healthcare needs of underserved families who face limited access to medical facilities. Residents received free medical consultations, health screenings, and essential medicines. The initiative supported early identification of common health conditions and provided timely treatment to individuals who may otherwise have been unable to access healthcare services due to financial or geographical barriers.)
/E (The first medical camp was successfully conducted in Dhabeweli, District Rahim Yar Khan, providing essential healthcare services to approximately 250 community members. The camp was organized to address the healthcare needs of underserved families who face limited access to medical facilities. Residents received free medical consultations, health screenings, and essential medicines. The initiative supported early identification of common health conditions and provided timely treatment to individuals who may otherwise have been unable to access healthcare services due to financial or geographical barriers.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
